{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_042_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6138ad75f7b33c97d3ffa0be4ad63ba19c4ec1418830577f29943523923fa76a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c339532d281f49fe18eeba6f41ac78cb0c250aa656b7e8c5aeee998560aed995",
      "text": "外景当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c421848fcb67e6cc9f98ddf78d7af9f2ec7b9e44cb0621c7a114b9da72e5fb5",
      "text": "外景顺利结束真是太好了呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:083a3a25da3a094ed36229baea9247b42febb602d979c8ddc96fabce29eae2ff",
      "text": "是啊。不过，拍摄中老鼠跑出来的时候\n我还以为要遭了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:faf0ed6fae6ebd16e02e767f5659fcb3e9c5a9d0a630ed6991ba8e81e097fe11",
      "text": "啊啊，是俺慌慌张张逃跑的时候吧。\n也多亏了那样才找到了大宝贝就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:590df503f06f90203aa7c61a8b4d589754eeee33920564ee65c6e2043b9f01d6",
      "text": "那真是今天最让俺吃惊的事了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e1dab5794781a0e0948b84687254305921cd3ba70d056b740138b0b6aa6a8b5",
      "text": "虽说确实如此，\n但您居然还懂刀剑的好坏，真厉害啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c53c610ca106419fed8154c1a8d603d51ff176418d8500f9019160c079b6d5aa",
      "text": "哇哈哈！碰巧而已啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e661ac02bf334f216bbf665b19b010dfe0b99846011d6d5365763e85da97f7c3",
      "text": "俺练居合道的嘛，\n练习时经常能看到刀剑的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e3c63640024e6cfc5a04d01ed41b273c0029fba3998dfecec60df37029e9cad",
      "text": "话说回来，真没想到能遇上那样的名刀啊！\n哇哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d467ffd77499cb7eef66f2c807081e17f1ecd3851a4f3f2d70a44bc1067451f",
      "text": "节目的导演也高兴得不行，\n直呼“竟然能找到这样的宝物！”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b336bfdf3c2e92fb139d8a726d3efdd52aaeef86969f4b0301ab77fdffc3d1ae",
      "text": "能看到那个笑容，俺也很高兴啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
